  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.5.1:\n      - Adds fluent convention member configuration with explicit member sources, required destination rules, null substitution, converters, and conditional mapping.\n      - Adds enum mapping support plus nullable and numeric conversion diagnostics.\n      - Expands mapping plans so configured member behavior is visible in diagnostics.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
